do_2 = "dispatch.mjs gains --watch: rescan state/jobs every tick so jobs generated while others run start when a worker is free, stop on state/STOP, and write state/dispatch-loop.json (queued, running, settled, backoff) every tick. Makefile gains platform-install, platform-build and platform-test targets that call pnpm under platform/."
do_3 = "96_sandbox_toolkit.sh keeps passing with the stub SDK and gains a --codex and a --watch case; 0_8.sh asserts the Makefile targets exist and that gen-jobs --codex hyperfide-v22 0.8 writes a job and a packet containing the preamble under a temporary HF_FLEET_CONFIG. operations.md documents the image steps and the measured base-build time."
